[
  {
    "text": "The cartoon ran in every",
    "start": 0.04,
    "end": 1.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Hearst paper in America.",
    "start": 1.28,
    "end": 3.08
  },
  {
    "text": "A fat man, in a",
    "start": 3.08,
    "end": 3.83
  },
  {
    "text": "suit covered in dollar signs,",
    "start": 3.83,
    "end": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "smoking a cigar the size",
    "start": 5.76,
    "end": 7.22
  },
  {
    "text": "of his forearm.",
    "start": 7.22,
    "end": 8.36
  },
  {
    "text": "The caption changed every week.",
    "start": 8.36,
    "end": 10.3
  },
  {
    "text": "The man did not.",
    "start": 10.3,
    "end": 11.56
  },
  {
    "text": "His name was Mark Hanna.",
    "start": 11.56,
    "end": 13.31
  },
  {
    "text": "And in eighteen ninety-six, he",
    "start": 13.31,
    "end": 14.75
  },
  {
    "text": "did something no one had",
    "start": 14.75,
    "end": 15.89
  },
  {
    "text": "ever done at that scale.",
    "start": 15.89,
    "end": 17.2
  },
  {
    "text": "He turned the American presidential",
    "start": 17.2,
    "end": 18.92
  },
  {
    "text": "election into a corporate purchase",
    "start": 18.92,
    "end": 20.8
  },
  {
    "text": "order.",
    "start": 20.8,
    "end": 21.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Three and a half million",
    "start": 21.28,
    "end": 22.73
  },
  {
    "text": "dollars raised.",
    "start": 22.73,
    "end": 23.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Twenty times what his opponent",
    "start": 23.72,
    "end": 25.21
  },
  {
    "text": "spent.",
    "start": 25.21,
    "end": 25.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Banks assessed at a quarter",
    "start": 25.68,
    "end": 27.07
  },
  {
    "text": "of a percent of capital.",
    "start": 27.07,
    "end": 28.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Railroads, shaken down personally.",
    "start": 28.48,
    "end": 30.82
  },
  {
    "text": "Standard Oil, two hundred and",
    "start": 30.82,
    "end": 31.94
  },
  {
    "text": "fifty thousand dollars.",
    "start": 31.94,
    "end": 33.76
  },
  {
    "text": "JP Morgan, two hundred and",
    "start": 33.76,
    "end": 34.61
  },
  {
    "text": "fifty thousand dollars.",
    "start": 34.61,
    "end": 36.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Half a million voters, transported",
    "start": 36.68,
    "end": 38.44
  },
  {
    "text": "by train, to shake one",
    "start": 38.44,
    "end": 39.69
  },
  {
    "text": "man's hand.",
    "start": 39.69,
    "end": 40.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Two hundred million pieces of",
    "start": 40.6,
    "end": 41.86
  },
  {
    "text": "campaign literature, printed and mailed.",
    "start": 41.86,
    "end": 44.36
  },
  {
    "text": "The opposition had a thirty-six",
    "start": 44.36,
    "end": 45.43
  },
  {
    "text": "year old preacher who could",
    "start": 45.43,
    "end": 47.48
  },
  {
    "text": "move a crowd to tears.",
    "start": 47.48,
    "end": 48.9
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna had a ledger.",
    "start": 48.9,
    "end": 50.27
  },
  {
    "text": "And when November came, the",
    "start": 50.27,
    "end": 51.68
  },
  {
    "text": "ledger won.",
    "start": 51.68,
    "end": 52.36
  },
  {
    "text": "He wasn't born with money.",
    "start": 52.36,
    "end": 53.84
  },
  {
    "text": "He was born in a",
    "start": 53.84,
    "end": 54.7
  },
  {
    "text": "grocery.",
    "start": 54.7,
    "end": 55.48
  },
  {
    "text": "New Lisbon, Ohio.",
    "start": 55.48,
    "end": 56.86
  },
  {
    "text": "Eighteen thirty-seven.",
    "start": 56.86,
    "end": 58.14
  },
  {
    "text": "His father, Doctor Leonard Hanna,",
    "start": 58.18,
    "end": 59.85
  },
  {
    "text": "was a country physician who",
    "start": 59.85,
    "end": 60.97
  },
  {
    "text": "ran a wholesale grocery on",
    "start": 60.97,
    "end": 62.51
  },
  {
    "text": "the side.",
    "start": 62.51,
    "end": 63.22
  },
  {
    "text": "Flour, salt, dry goods to",
    "start": 63.22,
    "end": 64.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Ohio farmers.",
    "start": 64.96,
    "end": 66.08
  },
  {
    "text": "When Mark was fifteen, the",
    "start": 66.08,
    "end": 67.43
  },
  {
    "text": "family moved to Cleveland.",
    "start": 67.43,
    "end": 69.04
  },
  {
    "text": "He enrolled at Western Reserve",
    "start": 69.04,
    "end": 70.97
  },
  {
    "text": "College.",
    "start": 70.97,
    "end": 71.4
  },
  {
    "text": "In his class, was a",
    "start": 71.4,
    "end": 72.52
  },
  {
    "text": "quiet, awkward boy who would",
    "start": 72.52,
    "end": 74.35
  },
  {
    "text": "grow up to control ninety",
    "start": 74.35,
    "end": 75.2
  },
  {
    "text": "percent of the oil refining",
    "start": 75.2,
    "end": 77.28
  },
  {
    "text": "capacity in the United States.",
    "start": 77.28,
    "end": 79.36
  },
  {
    "text": "His name was John D.",
    "start": 79.36,
    "end": 80.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Rockefeller.",
    "start": 80.56,
    "end": 81.54
  },
  {
    "text": "The two would orbit each",
    "start": 81.54,
    "end": 82.49
  },
  {
    "text": "other for the next forty",
    "start": 82.49,
    "end": 83.88
  },
  {
    "text": "years.",
    "start": 83.88,
    "end": 84.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna lasted one year at",
    "start": 84.48,
    "end": 85.71
  },
  {
    "text": "Western Reserve before he quit.",
    "start": 85.71,
    "end": 87.5
  },
  {
    "text": "Not because he was failing.",
    "start": 87.5,
    "end": 88.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Because he had already figured",
    "start": 88.96,
    "end": 90.03
  },
  {
    "text": "out something the professors couldn't",
    "start": 90.03,
    "end": 91.84
  },
  {
    "text": "teach.",
    "start": 91.84,
    "end": 92.24
  },
  {
    "text": "The real education, was in",
    "start": 92.24,
    "end": 93.59
  },
  {
    "text": "the price of things.",
    "start": 93.59,
    "end": 94.84
  },
  {
    "text": "He went back to the",
    "start": 94.84,
    "end": 95.69
  },
  {
    "text": "store.",
    "start": 95.69,
    "end": 96.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Worked the floor.",
    "start": 96.12,
    "end": 97.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Watched how men negotiated.",
    "start": 97.12,
    "end": 98.94
  },
  {
    "text": "Watched who paid on time",
    "start": 98.94,
    "end": 100.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and who didn't.",
    "start": 100.24,
    "end": 101.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Watched which suppliers had leverage,",
    "start": 101.2,
    "end": 103.2
  },
  {
    "text": "and which ones begged.",
    "start": 103.2,
    "end": 104.34
  },
  {
    "text": "Then the Civil War came.",
    "start": 104.34,
    "end": 105.64
  },
  {
    "text": "He served briefly.",
    "start": 105.64,
    "end": 106.9
  },
  {
    "text": "Came home.",
    "start": 106.9,
    "end": 107.88
  },
  {
    "text": "And married a woman named",
    "start": 107.88,
    "end": 109.09
  },
  {
    "text": "Charlotte Rhodes.",
    "start": 109.09,
    "end": 110.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Her father was Daniel Rhodes.",
    "start": 110.2,
    "end": 111.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Coal and iron.",
    "start": 111.96,
    "end": 112.8
  },
  {
    "text": "One of the men quietly",
    "start": 112.8,
    "end": 113.64
  },
  {
    "text": "getting rich off everything Cleveland",
    "start": 113.64,
    "end": 115.48
  },
  {
    "text": "was becoming.",
    "start": 115.48,
    "end": 116.28
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna walked into that business,",
    "start": 116.32,
    "end": 117.68
  },
  {
    "text": "and never walked out.",
    "start": 117.68,
    "end": 119.0
  },
  {
    "text": "By eighteen sixty-seven, Marcus Alonzo",
    "start": 119.0,
    "end": 121.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna had built MA Hanna",
    "start": 121.0,
    "end": 122.7
  },
  {
    "text": "and Company.",
    "start": 122.7,
    "end": 123.6
  },
  {
    "text": "A coal and iron brokerage,",
    "start": 123.6,
    "end": 125.32
  },
  {
    "text": "sitting at the exact pivot",
    "start": 125.32,
    "end": 126.85
  },
  {
    "text": "point where Lake Erie ore",
    "start": 126.85,
    "end": 128.31
  },
  {
    "text": "boats unloaded for the Pittsburgh",
    "start": 128.31,
    "end": 130.04
  },
  {
    "text": "steel mills.",
    "start": 130.04,
    "end": 130.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Cleveland was the chokepoint.",
    "start": 130.8,
    "end": 132.54
  },
  {
    "text": "And Hanna sat on it.",
    "start": 132.54,
    "end": 133.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Every ton of iron ore",
    "start": 133.72,
    "end": 134.88
  },
  {
    "text": "that crossed Lake Erie in",
    "start": 134.88,
    "end": 135.97
  },
  {
    "text": "the eighteen seventies, passed through",
    "start": 135.97,
    "end": 137.58
  },
  {
    "text": "brokers like him, he took",
    "start": 137.58,
    "end": 138.98
  },
  {
    "text": "a cut.",
    "start": 138.98,
    "end": 139.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Then he bought the newspaper,",
    "start": 139.64,
    "end": 140.87
  },
  {
    "text": "the Cleveland Herald.",
    "start": 140.87,
    "end": 141.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Then a theater.",
    "start": 141.92,
    "end": 142.83
  },
  {
    "text": "Then banking interests.",
    "start": 142.83,
    "end": 144.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Then a streetcar line.",
    "start": 144.2,
    "end": 145.64
  },
  {
    "text": "By eighteen eighty, he controlled",
    "start": 145.68,
    "end": 146.94
  },
  {
    "text": "enough of Cleveland that when",
    "start": 146.94,
    "end": 148.18
  },
  {
    "text": "he walked into a room,",
    "start": 148.18,
    "end": 149.08
  },
  {
    "text": "the room changed temperature.",
    "start": 149.08,
    "end": 150.92
  },
  {
    "text": "And he was bored.",
    "start": 150.92,
    "end": 151.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Not with money, he had",
    "start": 151.96,
    "end": 153.14
  },
  {
    "text": "money.",
    "start": 153.14,
    "end": 153.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Bored with the ceiling.",
    "start": 153.48,
    "end": 154.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Because Hanna had figured out,",
    "start": 154.84,
    "end": 156.2
  },
  {
    "text": "watching the men who supplied",
    "start": 156.2,
    "end": 157.65
  },
  {
    "text": "his coal, the politicians who",
    "start": 157.65,
    "end": 159.27
  },
  {
    "text": "regulated his railroads, the judges",
    "start": 159.27,
    "end": 161.38
  },
  {
    "text": "who settled his contracts, that",
    "start": 161.38,
    "end": 163.08
  },
  {
    "text": "money was the second most",
    "start": 163.08,
    "end": 164.33
  },
  {
    "text": "powerful thing in America.",
    "start": 164.33,
    "end": 165.84
  },
  {
    "text": "The most powerful thing, was",
    "start": 165.84,
    "end": 167.12
  },
  {
    "text": "who decided where the money",
    "start": 167.12,
    "end": 168.46
  },
  {
    "text": "went.",
    "start": 168.46,
    "end": 168.96
  },
  {
    "text": "That was politics.",
    "start": 168.96,
    "end": 170.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And no one had ever",
    "start": 170.12,
    "end": 170.96
  },
  {
    "text": "run it like a business.",
    "start": 170.96,
    "end": 172.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Not yet.",
    "start": 172.12,
    "end": 172.96
  },
  {
    "text": "The year was eighteen eighty-eight.",
    "start": 172.96,
    "end": 174.88
  },
  {
    "text": "The Republican National Convention.",
    "start": 174.92,
    "end": 177.25
  },
  {
    "text": "Chicago.",
    "start": 177.25,
    "end": 178.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Mark Hanna arrived not as",
    "start": 178.0,
    "end": 179.36
  },
  {
    "text": "a candidate, but as a",
    "start": 179.36,
    "end": 180.52
  },
  {
    "text": "kingmaker.",
    "start": 180.52,
    "end": 181.28
  },
  {
    "text": "His man was John Sherman.",
    "start": 181.28,
    "end": 182.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Ohio senator.",
    "start": 182.96,
    "end": 183.94
  },
  {
    "text": "Treasury veteran.",
    "start": 183.94,
    "end": 185.24
  },
  {
    "text": "The establishment choice.",
    "start": 185.24,
    "end": 186.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna worked the convention floor",
    "start": 186.8,
    "end": 188.24
  },
  {
    "text": "for six days.",
    "start": 188.24,
    "end": 189.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Trading delegates.",
    "start": 189.24,
    "end": 190.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Promising postmasterships.",
    "start": 190.36,
    "end": 192.02
  },
  {
    "text": "Calling in markers from Ohio",
    "start": 192.02,
    "end": 193.71
  },
  {
    "text": "to Pennsylvania.",
    "start": 193.71,
    "end": 194.9
  },
  {
    "text": "Sherman peaked on the first",
    "start": 194.9,
    "end": 196.63
  },
  {
    "text": "ballot at two hundred and",
    "start": 196.63,
    "end": 197.23
  },
  {
    "text": "twenty-nine votes.",
    "start": 197.23,
    "end": 198.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Then he bled out.",
    "start": 198.56,
    "end": 199.63
  },
  {
    "text": "Ballot after ballot, until the",
    "start": 199.63,
    "end": 201.36
  },
  {
    "text": "nomination went to Benjamin Harrison",
    "start": 201.36,
    "end": 203.32
  },
  {
    "text": "on the eighth.",
    "start": 203.32,
    "end": 204.3
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna lost.",
    "start": 204.34,
    "end": 205.4
  },
  {
    "text": "But he saw something that",
    "start": 205.4,
    "end": 206.54
  },
  {
    "text": "week he would never forget.",
    "start": 206.54,
    "end": 207.88
  },
  {
    "text": "A forty-five year old congressman",
    "start": 207.88,
    "end": 209.72
  },
  {
    "text": "from Canton, Ohio had been",
    "start": 209.72,
    "end": 211.54
  },
  {
    "text": "chairing the resolutions committee.",
    "start": 211.54,
    "end": 213.48
  },
  {
    "text": "When delegates began breaking toward",
    "start": 213.48,
    "end": 215.19
  },
  {
    "text": "him as a dark-horse alternative,",
    "start": 215.19,
    "end": 217.1
  },
  {
    "text": "the congressman walked to the",
    "start": 217.1,
    "end": 218.63
  },
  {
    "text": "microphone, and refused.",
    "start": 218.63,
    "end": 220.08
  },
  {
    "text": "He told the convention he",
    "start": 220.08,
    "end": 221.44
  },
  {
    "text": "was bound to Sherman.",
    "start": 221.44,
    "end": 222.58
  },
  {
    "text": "And he sat down.",
    "start": 222.58,
    "end": 223.8
  },
  {
    "text": "That kind of loyalty was",
    "start": 223.8,
    "end": 225.25
  },
  {
    "text": "rare in eighteen eighty-eight politics.",
    "start": 225.25,
    "end": 227.44
  },
  {
    "text": "It was almost extinct.",
    "start": 227.44,
    "end": 229.0
  },
  {
    "text": "His name was William McKinley.",
    "start": 229.0,
    "end": 231.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Hanna walked across the floor,",
    "start": 231.12,
    "end": 232.84
  },
  {
    "text": "and introduced himself.",
    "start": 232.84,
    "end": 233.92
  },
  {
    "text": "He didn't know it yet.",
    "start": 233.96,
    "end": 235.61
  },
  {
    "text": "But he had just found",
    "start": 235.61,
    "end": 236.54
  },
  {
    "text": "his president.",
    "start": 236.54,
    "end": 237.38
  }
]
